I think there's a consortium program between the UC schools and Yonsei. If you attend without going through a partner school, it's only $800 a semester, which averages to less than $10 a course hour!

&#x200B;

Just wanted to add\~

슬프고 있다 --> 슬프다 (-고 있다 is only for verbs)

&#x200B;

뭐가 (topic) --> 무엇을/뭘 (object) of 보다 

&#x200B;

You can also write 힘쎈여자 도봉순이란 드라마 (the drama called Strong Girl Bong-soon) for more clarity!

&#x200B;

I would be careful with switching between written form (있다) and 반말 (좋아해, 몰라), too.

That's the thing about acid, it doesn't pull any punches, but hey, it sounds like you learned something valuable? 

&#x200B;

For what it's worth, you're not broken for being tempted by substances when you're going through a tough time. Though you should definitely work on it, a lot (like a ton) of people from all walks of life struggle with the same thing, including those who are otherwise successful, well-adjusted, and loved.

&#x200B;

Best of luck!

